                    </ref>, section entitled “Meeting of the Foreign Ministers of the American
                    Republics…”</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d724-f2" n="36" xml:id="d724-f2-content">
                <p>Mauricio Nabuco, Secretary General of the Brazilian Foreign Office.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d724-f3" n="37" xml:id="d724-f3-content">
                <p>Oswaldo Aranha, Brazilian Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d724-f4" n="38" xml:id="d724-f4-content">
                <p>Signed October 3, 1939, Department of State <hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Bulletin</hi>, October 7, 1939, p. 321; for correspondence concerning meeting
                    of the Foreign Ministers of the American Republics at Panama, September
                    23–October 3, 1939, see <ref target="frus1939v05">vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">v</hi>
                    </ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
